  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia arbetar med gr&#xe4;srotsorganisationer f&#xf6;r demokrati, lokal utveckling, m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter mm p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;. S&#xe4;rskilt intresse f&#xf6;r kvinnor och barns situation och r&#xe4;ttigheter. I programmet finns 10 samarbetsorganisationer i olika delar av landet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia is primarily working with grassrotsorganizations in the country. In this program ten counterpart organizations are involved in different aspects of human rights, democratization and local developmetn etc. Special attention is given on children and women.</narrative>
  </description>
